  "remarks": "PJSC TransContainer is a Russian transportation company and Russia’s largest railway container operator. PJSC TransContainer offers its services at the new terminal of the Alabuga Special Economic Zone (SEZ). The Alabuga SEZ has been cooperating with the Ministry of Defence and Logistics of the Iranian Armed Forces to locate the production site of Shahed loitering munitions (the name of the Russian version is “Geran”).",
